<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/20th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Russo-Japanese War</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1905">1905</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Russo-Japanese War was a conflict between the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russian-empire">Russian Empire</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/empire-of-japan">Empire of Japan</a> over influence in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/manchuria">Manchuria</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/korea">Korea</a>, concluded by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-portsmouth">Treaty of Portsmouth</a> in 1905. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/japan">Japan</a> won decisive victories on land and at sea, including the destruction of the Russian fleet at Tsushima. It was the first major modern victory of an Asian power over a European one, raising Japan's international standing and contributing to revolutionary unrest in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russia">Russia</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/russo-japanese-war.jpg" alt="Russo-Japanese War" width="300" height="420" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Original uploader and author was Dustandshadow at en.wikipedia · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:RUSSOJAPANESEWARIMAGE.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
